  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserverminer.com%252fcurse%252fspace-astronomy-2-server-hosting\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.gyazo.com/31d0bbf887ffe0cb6dd81730e8f6f20b.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"680\" height=\"200\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>透過我們的合作夥伴 ServerMiner，只需單擊即可創建屬於您的 Space Astronomy 2 伺服器：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserverminer.com%252fcurse%252fspace-astronomy-2-server-hosting\" rel=\"nofollow\">點擊這裡</a>，使用優惠碼 MJRLegends 享受 8 折優惠。無需任何技術知識，即可立即設定！</strong></p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>此整合包已不再提供支援/更新，敬請見諒</strong></p>\n<hr>\n<p><strong>Space Astronomy 2&nbsp;</strong>是一款以太空為主題的模組整合包，收錄了大量最新的科技與太空模組。您可以借助提供的成就書籍來探索宇宙，該書籍將引導您完成所需的步驟。</p>\n<hr>\n<blockquote>\n<h3><strong>漏洞資訊：</strong></h3>\n<h3><strong>整合包 V1.5.7 及以下版本包含 BiblioCraft：請查看漏洞詳情：<em> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.reddit.com%252fr%252ffeedthebeast%252fcomments%252fyfe57z%252f17_112_bibliocraft_oversight_allows_writing_nbt%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.reddit.com/r/feedthebeast/comments/yfe57z/17_112_bibliocraft_oversight_allows_writing_nbt/</a>&nbsp;&amp;&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.creeperhost.net%252fblog%252fmitigating-bibliocraft-rce%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.creeperhost.net/blog/mitigating-bibliocraft-rce/</a></em></strong></h3>\n<h3><strong><em>已修復版本（模組已移除）：v1.5.9（或以上）</em></strong></h3>\n<h3><strong><br>整合包 V1.5.7 及以下版本包含 EnderCore/EnderIO &amp; BDLib：請查看漏洞詳情：<em><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fblog.mmpa.info%252fposts%252fbleeding-pipe\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://blog.mmpa.info/posts/bleeding-pipe</a><br></em></strong></h3>\n<h3><strong><em>已修復版本（模組已更新）：v1.5.9（或以上）</em></strong></h3>\n</blockquote>\n<h3><strong><em>請自行承擔使用此整合包的風險，並請先進行相關調查！</em></strong></h3>\n<hr>\n<p><strong>RAM/記憶體需求：</strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>客戶端：</strong></p>\n<p>最低（啟動整合包時）：3840 MB</p>\n<p>推薦/可遊玩：4352 MB 及以上（視您世界的進度而定）</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>伺服器：</strong></p>\n<p>最低：即將更新</p>\n<p>推薦：即將更新</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong><strong>您可以在<a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/space-astronomy-2/files\" rel=\"nofollow\">這裡</a>或整合包的主選單中找到伺服器檔案！</strong></strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>注意：如有任何錯誤或問題，請<a href=\"https://github.com/MJRLegends/Space-Astronomy-2-Feedback-/issues\" rel=\"nofollow\">在此</a>回報！</strong></p>\n<hr>\n<p><strong>更新日誌 - <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fpastebin.com%252fsT3e0wLd\" rel=\"nofollow\">這裡</a></strong></p>\n<p><strong>問題追蹤器 - <a href=\"https://github.com/MJRLegends/Space-Astronomy-2-Feedback-/issues\" rel=\"nofollow\">這裡</a></strong></p>\n<p><strong>已知問題 - <a href=\"https://github.com/MJRLegends/Space-Astronomy-2-Feedback-/issues/99\" rel=\"nofollow\">這裡</a></strong></p>\n<p><strong>模組列表 - <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fpastebin.com%252f8uF9P9jh\" rel=\"nofollow\">這裡</a></strong></p>\n<hr>\n<p><strong>如何在 Curse/Twitch App 上變更 Minecraft 的 RAM 分配/使用量？&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdocs.mjrlegends.com%252fGeneral%2bMinecraft%252fram%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://docs.mjrlegends.com/General%20Minecraft/ram/</a></strong></p>\n<p><strong>如何在 Curse/Twitch App 上的 Minecraft 中尋找崩潰記錄檔？&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdocs.mjrlegends.com%252fGeneral%2bMinecraft%252fcrash-log%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://docs.mjrlegends.com/General%20Minecraft/crash-log/</a></strong></p>\n<p><strong>如何在新版 Twitch App 上安裝 Space Astronomy 1 &amp; 2？ <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fimgur.com%252fa%252fCYxre\" rel=\"nofollow\">http://imgur.com/a/CYxre</a> </strong></p>\n<p><strong>如何在新版 Twitch App 上遊玩模組整合包？ <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fimgur.com%252fa%252fcBNZs\" rel=\"nofollow\">http://imgur.com/a/cBNZs</a> </strong></p>\n<p><strong>如何下載 Space Astronomy 2 的伺服器檔案？&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdocs.mjrlegends.com%252fSpace%2bAstronomy%2b1%2b%2526%2b2%252fserver-files%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://docs.mjrlegends.com/Space%20Astronomy%201%20&amp;%202/server-files/</a></strong></p>\n<p><strong>常見問題 (FAQ)：&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdocs.mjrlegends.com%252fSpace%2bAstronomy%2b1%2b%2526%2b2%252ffaq%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://docs.mjrlegends.com/Space%20Astronomy%201%20&amp;%202/faq/</a></strong></p>",
